1 + a /  (1 + a)  = (1 + a)              (*)
      -
     i=0

Proof:

For i=0, lhs = 1 + a = rhs
Suppose for i=n, (*) holds
For i=n+1,
		     n+2
	lhs = (1 + a)
			     n+1
	    = (1 + a) (1 + a)

			     n
			     _
			     \ 	       i
	    = (1 + a) (1 + a /  (1 + a) )
                             -
